35,2,1,talk,Mizuki,,"The data is stark. General rooms are always full, while specialist ones sit empty. We need a space everyone can actually book.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Victoria,,The timetable records confirm my fear. Every room closed for works forces us to pay for off-site space for two terms.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,"The data is damning. Inspection-driven works hit deadlines; comfort projects slip a year. Plus, six weeks lost to weather. We must avoid exposed work.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Kenji,,"@Benjamin, that weather loss is brutal. My tender data shows mechanical costs jumped twenty percent, but we never saved for replacing old AV gear.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,"@Kenji, the staffing gap is real. Technicians are stuck doing manual checks because the old extraction gear fails. We need to fix the equipment, not just the budget.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Shunichi, that manual labor is a symptom. My data shows single-wing projects disappoint users. We need broad access, not just fixing one lab’s ventilation.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Mizuki, the booking data confirms it. Specialist rooms sit idle, yet general requests are turned away. We need broad, bookable access, not isolated niches.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Mizuki, @Victoria, I agree on the access point. But my data shows comfort projects slip a year. We need a plan that avoids weather exposure and inspection delays.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Benjamin, @Mizuki, I agree. My data shows we never saved for replacements, so we’re bleeding money. We need a plan that doesn’t rely on outdated gear or endless manual fixes.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Mizuki, @Victoria, I hear you on access. But my data shows unfilled posts and technicians drowning in manual checks. We can’t just add space; we need to fix the staffing bottleneck first.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Mizuki,,"@Shunichi, I hear your concern, but my data shows broad access drives satisfaction. We need a plan that serves everyone, not just one wing.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
